text:
Add native support for LangChain-style message history in the Chat Input component

### Feature Request

Enable the Chat Input component to accept LangChain-style message objects, preserving roles and message order automatically.
Example format:

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Hi!" },
    { "role": "assistant", "content": "Hello! How are you?" },
    { "role": "user", "content": "I'm fine, thanks!" }
  ]
}


Langflow should be able to parse and manage this structure internally, so users can build multi-turn chat flows without custom parsers or manual splitt…
